### 5\. CONSOLIDATE THE EXISTING VIDEO ARCHITECTURE

The repository currently has two publishing paths:

Create Post video publishing

```text
CreateVideo.jsx
    ↓
postMediaPipeline.js
    ↓
postPublishPipeline.js
    ↓
posts/{postId}
```

Dedicated video publishing

```text
